msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Questo salvaschermo è stato rimosso dalla distribuzione XScreenSaver a "
"partire da\n"
"versione 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"Un automa cellulare che in realtà è una macchina di Turing bidimensionale:\n"
"man mano che le teste (\"formiche\") camminano sullo schermo, cambiano "
"pixel\n"
"valori sul loro cammino.  Quindi, mentre passano sopra i pixel modificati, "
"il loro\n"
"il comportamento viene influenzato.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Scritto da David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "

